Adapted parts:
- localcut/lmstudio.py: the LM Studio chat client (OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions,
  reasoning_effort, <think> stripping, image data URLs) is adapted from server.py `_chat`.
- The "checklist" judging style (the model reports observations per criterion and the
  verdict is computed in code) follows server.py `visual_review`.
- bench/ result layout (environment.json / raw.jsonl / summary.json) follows bench/common.py.
